    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Story\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/c7dfd24310f69be406575bac9cfc708b.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female warrior Rebecca is the strongest warrior in this small border village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebecca is not only powerful with swordsmanship but also very kind-hearted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She plays a role similar to the village guardian and is deeply trusted by the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Rebecca's village was attacked by a group of bandits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all the villagers were kidnapped, including Takezo, the person of her unrequited love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So Rebecca embarked on a journey, vowing to defeat the bandits and save the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a new continent, Rebecca obtained the magic sword &quot;Cursed Sword&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this magic sword will greatly change her destiny...!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bandits are defeated and Rebecca successfully takes back her sweetheart, what will happen to the strongest female warrior in the village?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Game Content\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/b280f0abe2074be459df7e519a187405.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Use the port town as your base and conquer each map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the progress, there will be more places to go to.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/8c980f8465b26fa93e38f229f70a2a92.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2You can fight a variety of enemies and gain experience points to level up.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/889e1ec4116f0af78ea1f0101bd263d3.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Various materials will drop on the map, and these materials can be exchanged for money.<br>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Story\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/c7dfd24310f69be406575bac9cfc708b.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The female warrior Rebecca is the strongest warrior in this small border village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebecca is not only powerful with swordsmanship but also very kind-hearted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She plays a role similar to the village guardian and is deeply trusted by the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Rebecca's village was attacked by a group of bandits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all the villagers were kidnapped, including Takezo, the person of her unrequited love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So Rebecca embarked on a journey, vowing to defeat the bandits and save the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a new continent, Rebecca obtained the magic sword &quot;Cursed Sword&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this magic sword will greatly change her destiny...!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bandits are defeated and Rebecca successfully takes back her sweetheart, what will happen to the strongest female warrior in the village?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2724Game Content\u2724</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/b280f0abe2074be459df7e519a187405.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Use the port town as your base and conquer each map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the progress, there will be more places to go to.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/8c980f8465b26fa93e38f229f70a2a92.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2You can fight a variety of enemies and gain experience points to level up.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158290/extras/889e1ec4116f0af78ea1f0101bd263d3.avif?t=1747384256\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Various materials will drop on the map, and these materials can be exchanged for money.<br>\u00a0</p>",
